<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1653] Need to remove lgpl-dependent examples from Ignite binaries</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1653</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Examples project from Ignite binaries couldn&apos;t be compiled due to there is lgpl-dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Solution: lgpl-dependent examples should be removed from Ignite src and bin&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Apache-Ignite-1.5.0 build #29&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
        <key id="12904138">IGNITE-1653</key>
            <summary>Need to remove lgpl-dependent examples from Ignite binaries</summary>
