                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14958866" author="ustas" created="Thu, 15 Oct 2015 13:11:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested in branch-1653. &lt;br/&gt;
Fix confirmed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14958951" author="avinogradov" created="Thu, 15 Oct 2015 14:01:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ilya,&lt;br/&gt;
Merged changes to master, check please.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14960617" author="skozlov" created="Fri, 16 Oct 2015 12:51:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hibernate-related files are still presented in examples directory in Apache Ingite Fabric binary package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;examples/config/hibernate/
examples/config/hibernate/README.txt
examples/config/hibernate/example-hibernate-L2-cache.xml
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="14963497" author="ustas" created="Mon, 19 Oct 2015 15:51:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Re-checked in master.&lt;br/&gt;
In pom.xml (no-lgpl package) there are 2 dependencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;org.apache.ignite&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;ignite-hibernate&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;version&amp;gt;1.5.0-QAIS1910&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;org.apache.ignite&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;ignite-schedule&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;version&amp;gt;1.5.0-QAIS1910&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;they weren&apos;t supposed to be there.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14964685" author="avinogradov" created="Tue, 20 Oct 2015 07:13:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please check fixes&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14965025" author="avinogradov" created="Tue, 20 Oct 2015 12:18:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Strategy changed. &lt;br/&gt;
goin to use lgpl profile at examples.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14971232" author="avinogradov" created="Fri, 23 Oct 2015 16:00:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Current solution:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;sources - lgpl off by default, but can be switched on without issues&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;apache-ignite-fabric-lgpl - lgpl on, causes no compilation issues in case Release released with lgpl profile (released by some other person/company, because community cannot provide lgpl release)&lt;br/&gt;
apache-ignite-fabric - lgpl off, swithing on causes compilation issues. README.txt explains how to solve this issues.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14974278" author="avinogradov" created="Mon, 26 Oct 2015 14:26:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed ad master&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14976202" author="vsidorova" created="Tue, 27 Oct 2015 10:37:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fix verified for Apache Ignite 1.5.0 build #46 &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
